		{
			description: [
				"It is recognized that after some times it just feels like the vanilla progression is as a mere preparation for getting to actually play your game and engage in the mechanics you care about."
				""
				"That's why this pack allows you to skip the bog standard Minecraft progression where you to the nether for blaze rods then to the end to kill the Ender Dragon."
				""
				"Instead, purely in the overworld, you get to \"trade\" all those weapons for otherworldly materials."
			]
			id: "12916EE1AE02D174"
			subtitle: "Tired of the old ways?"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0563C7ECB3091B8C"
				title: "Yes, let's try something else"
